990:| OBS-ACK-ORDER | commitPosition, tSourcePublished, tAck, ackSender, ryowPullRoute | PASS iff the source of truth sent every ACK, tAck >= tSourcePublished for every commit, and every pull at a returned position was served by an eligible index or the fallback |
